Package: pahscrna
Title: Guardrailed Single-Cell Utilities for the PAH Transcriptomics Project
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("PAH", "Project", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: Reusable, project-safe utilities adapted from the GEO single-cell
    workflow described by ITWANGYANG. The package validates subject-level
    metadata, creates pseudobulk count matrices, manages resumable checkpoints,
    and exposes explicit optional-module checks without treating cells as
    biological replicates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: Matrix
Suggests: edgeR, SeuratObject, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
